{"seq":1,"slug":"quadtree-lod","title":"四叉树 LOD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/lod/quadtree-lod","wordCount":1643,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"四叉树-lod\">四叉树 LOD</h1><p>地形 LOD 最符合直觉的实现，是把地表当成一张可以反复对折的纸：整片地形是一个大方块，离视点近的地方就把它四分成四个小方块，还嫌粗就继续四分，直到精度足够。这种&quot;按需递归四分&quot;的结构就是四叉树，它几乎是每个引擎地形系统的起点。它的难点从来不是怎么细分，而是细分之后——相邻两块精度不同的地方，网格会裂开。这一篇讲清四叉树如何选 LOD，以及如何把裂缝缝好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-递归四分与-lod-选择\">核心概念：递归四分与 LOD 选择</h2><p>四叉树把地形递归地切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 叉层级：根节点覆盖整片地形，每个节点可选择细分成四个覆盖各自象限的子节点。每个节点对应一块固定顶点数的网格（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>33</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">33 \\times 33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span></span></span></span></span>），层级越深、覆盖的世界范围越小、相对精度越高。</p>\n<p>是否继续细分，由该节点到视点的距离决定。常用的判据是屏幕空间误差：节点不细分时引入的几何误差投影到屏幕上若小于阈值（如 1 像素），就停止细分。一个简化的实用判据是把节点边长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 与距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的比值和常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 比较：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>细分当</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{细分当} \\quad \\frac{L}{d} &gt; \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">细分当</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，地形整体越精细但开销越高。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 就是 LOD 系统暴露给性能调优的主旋钮。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[根节点&lt;br/&gt;覆盖整片地形] --&gt; B{到视点距离&lt;br/&gt;L/d &gt; τ?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否 够粗| C[此节点直接出网格]&#10;    B --&gt;|是 太粗| D[四分为 4 子节点]&#10;    D --&gt; E[子节点 NW]&#10;    D --&gt; F[子节点 NE]&#10;    D --&gt; G[子节点 SW]&#10;    D --&gt; H[子节点 SE]&#10;    E --&gt; I[各子节点递归判断]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[叶子集合 = 本帧 LOD 切分]\">flowchart TD\n    A[根节点&lt;br/&gt;覆盖整片地形] --&gt; B{到视点距离&lt;br/&gt;L/d &gt; τ?}\n    B --&gt;|否 够粗| C[此节点直接出网格]\n    B --&gt;|是 太粗| D[四分为 4 子节点]\n    D --&gt; E[子节点 NW]\n    D --&gt; F[子节点 NE]\n    D --&gt; G[子节点 SW]\n    D --&gt; H[子节点 SE]\n    E --&gt; I[各子节点递归判断]\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[叶子集合 = 本帧 LOD 切分]</pre><p>下表把四叉树与 hub 里另一条 LOD 路线 <a href=\"geometry-clipmaps\">几何裁剪图</a> 放在一起对照，帮助你理解它在 LOD 谱系里的位置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>四叉树 LOD</th>\n<th>几何裁剪图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>划分依据</td>\n<td>按内容/距离自适应分块</td>\n<td>按视点固定嵌套同心环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度分布</td>\n<td>任意区域可独立加密</td>\n<td>严格随距离分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接缝处理</td>\n<td>需显式缝合相邻 LOD</td>\n<td>环间过渡区天然处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 开销</td>\n<td>每帧遍历/更新树</td>\n<td>极低，几乎纯 GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合地形</td>\n<td>起伏不均、有重点区域</td>\n<td>大体均匀、视点平移为主</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"接缝问题-t-junction-与裂缝从何而来\">接缝问题：T-junction 与裂缝从何而来</h2><p>四叉树的麻烦全部集中在边界。设想一个高精度块（每边 32 段）紧挨一个低精度块（每边 16 段）。高精度块边缘的顶点比低精度块多一倍，多出来的那些顶点落在低精度块边缘的两个顶点连成的直线<strong>之外</strong>——因为该处地形并非严格平直，于是边界两侧出现一条几何不连续的缝隙，这就是裂缝；即使顶点恰好对齐，光照插值的不连续也会形成可见的 T-junction 接缝。</p>\n<p>关键约束是相邻块的 LOD 层级差。如果不加限制，一个 LOD 0 的块可能紧邻一个 LOD 4 的块，缝合极其困难。实践中普遍施加 <strong>2:1 平衡约束</strong>（restricted quadtree）：任意两个相邻叶子节点的层级差不超过 1。这把需要处理的接缝情形从无穷多种压到有限几种，是后续所有缝合方案的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缝合方案-裙边-边缘退化与索引切换\">缝合方案：裙边、边缘退化与索引切换</h2><p>在 2:1 平衡之上，主流缝合手段有三类，各有取舍：</p>\n<p>**裙边（skirt）**最简单粗暴：沿每块边缘垂直向下拉出一圈三角形，像桌布的下摆。即使相邻块有缝，下摆也把缝挡在了视线后面。它几乎零成本、永远有效，缺点是裙边的着色可能在掠射角下露馅，且多画了一圈三角形。它是性能敏感场景（移动端）的默认选择。</p>\n<p>**边缘退化（edge stitching）**更精致：让高精度块朝向低精度邻居的那条边，把多出来的中间顶点&quot;塌缩&quot;到相邻两个顶点的连线上，使边界两侧顶点完全对齐。这要求块在网格化时知道四个方向邻居各自的 LOD，因此通常预生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^4 = 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span> 套边缘变体索引缓冲，运行时按邻居组合选用。无多余三角形，质量最好，但实现与内存成本略高。</p>\n<p>**几何 Morph（geomorphing）**解决另一个问题——LOD 切换瞬间的&quot;跳变&quot;。当一个块从 LOD 2 切到 LOD 1，部分顶点会突然消失/出现造成地表抖动。Morph 让这些顶点在切换前的一小段距离内平滑插值到它们在低精度网格上的位置：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{morph} = (1 - t)\\, h_{high} + t\\, h_{low}, \\quad t \\in [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 随距离从 0 渐变到 1，切换发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时，此时高低精度几何已完全重合，切换不可见。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程权衡与现代变体\">工程权衡与现代变体</h2><p>纯 CPU 四叉树在大世界里有个隐忧：每帧遍历整棵树、更新顶点缓冲会吃 CPU。现代做法是把工作尽量推给 GPU——用一遍 compute shader 在 GPU 上做四叉树遍历与 LOD 选择，再用间接绘制提交，CPU 只维护粗粒度的流送。UE5 的 Nanite Landscape 更进一步，把&quot;选哪些三角形&quot;完全交给 Nanite 的集群 LOD，开发者几乎不再手写四叉树缝合——但它的代价是更高的基础显存与对硬件的要求，且 2026 年在位移地形上仍有边角问题，详见 <a href=\"../foundations/terrain-pipeline\">地形渲染管线</a> 对网格化路线的讨论。</p>\n<p>四叉树的另一个延伸是它天然适配 <a href=\"terrain-streaming\">大世界分块流送</a>：树的节点边界正好是流送的块边界，LOD 层级正好对应要加载的细节层级，二者常常共用同一棵树。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四叉树通过递归四分实现自适应 LOD，是否细分由屏幕空间误差 / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是核心调优旋钮。</li>\n<li>接缝裂缝源于相邻块顶点密度不同；先用 2:1 平衡约束把情形收敛，再缝合。</li>\n<li>三类缝合：裙边（便宜万能）、边缘退化（质量最好、需 16 套边缘索引）、几何 Morph（消除 LOD 切换跳变）。</li>\n<li>现代实现把树遍历推给 GPU，或直接交给 Nanite 的集群 LOD，但要权衡显存与硬件门槛。</li>\n<li>四叉树的节点结构天然与分块流送共用，LOD 层级即流送细节层级。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章另一条 LOD 路线：<a href=\"geometry-clipmaps\">几何裁剪图</a>——不分块、纯 GPU 的对照方案。</li>\n<li>四叉树如何驱动流送：<a href=\"terrain-streaming\">大世界分块流送</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/practice/hierarchical-pathfinding\">路径规划 · 分层寻路</a>——同样用四叉/层级结构按距离换精度的思想。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"四叉树 LOD","id":"四叉树-lod"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：递归四分与 LOD 选择","id":"核心概念-递归四分与-lod-选择"},{"level":2,"text":"接缝问题：T-junction 与裂缝从何而来","id":"接缝问题-t-junction-与裂缝从何而来"},{"level":2,"text":"缝合方案：裙边、边缘退化与索引切换","id":"缝合方案-裙边-边缘退化与索引切换"},{"level":2,"text":"工程权衡与现代变体","id":"工程权衡与现代变体"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"体素与高度场之争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/foundations/voxel-vs-heightfield"},"next":{"title":"几何裁剪图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-terrain-systems/lod/geometry-clipmaps"}}